---
import "../styles/about.scss"
---

<section id="about">
    <h2 class="section-header">About</h2>
    <div class="section-content">
        <p class="section-text">
            Hello! I'm Jordon (not Jordan), welcome to my little popup shop. I'm currently a software developer at <a class="link" href="https://www.payworks.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Payworks</a>, and I've previously interned at <a class="link" href="https://www.priceline.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Priceline</a> and <a class="link" href="https://www.rbc.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">RBC</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
            I love community building and event planning, which is why I've spent years working with my university's <a class="link" href="https://devclub.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">.devClub</a> and Co-chair for <a class="link" href="https://2024.cusec.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CUSEC 2024</a> organizing hackathons and conferences for the student community.
        </p>
        <p class="section-text">
            When I'm not working, you can find me practicing Kpop choreos, playing R.E.P.O with friends, or awaiting the next season of Lord of the Mysteries.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>